# Static redirects file (processed WITHOUT a full build, unlike netlify.toml).
# Added 2026-06-23 for the new Pets + Software pillars because the site's
# onPostBuild plugin is failing, blocking full builds that would process new
# netlify.toml [[redirects]]. _redirects is read from the publish dir at deploy,
# so these route via `netlify deploy --no-build`. Merged before netlify.toml.
/pets/:id/reviews   /.netlify/functions/pulse-machine-entry?id=:id&kind=pet&view=reviews   200
/pets/:id/review    /.netlify/functions/pulse-machine-entry?id=:id&kind=pet&view=reviews   200
/pets/:id           /.netlify/functions/pulse-machine-entry?id=:id&kind=pet                200
/pets               /pets.html                                                              200
/software/:id/reviews  /.netlify/functions/pulse-machine-entry?id=:id&kind=software&view=reviews  200
/software/:id/review   /.netlify/functions/pulse-machine-entry?id=:id&kind=software&view=reviews  200
/software/:id          /.netlify/functions/pulse-machine-entry?id=:id&kind=software         200
/software              /software.html                                                       200
